<title>USA: Toyota January U.S. car sales up sharply.</title>
<headline>Toyota January U.S. car sales up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jan 1-31, 1997     Jan 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    54,643	    28,765	    +90.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  11,157	     8,807	    +26.7</p>
<p> Import Car		20,213	    19,448	     +3.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	    20,635	    11,567	    +78.4</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26 in year-ago period.</p>
</text>
